-- Choosing where lines end: the crate's `src/wrap_algorithms.rs` and
-- `src/wrap_algorithms/optimal_fit.rs`, with the SMAWK search from the
-- `smawk` crate that optimal fit rests on.
--
-- Both algorithms take fragments and the width of each line (the last width
-- serving for every line after), and answer each line as the range of
-- fragments on it, `(from, to)`, `to` exclusive.
